{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a relatively young solo indie game developer (me). The game revolves around two game modes:\u00a0<strong>Wave Survival</strong> (solo / co-op) and\u00a0<strong>PvP</strong> (1 vs 1 battles) on a procedurally generated maps, all presented in a cheerful pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, there are <strong>two</strong> factions in the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bees</strong> are a more aggressive, army-based faction focused on developing new technologies like electricity and creating long-range units.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Termites</strong> are more focused on base building, and their gameplay is closer to tower defense. The termites economy is based on transporting materials to the base using roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has <strong>procedurally generated</strong> maps with different biomes and a <strong>map editor</strong> where you can let your imagination run wild. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an <strong>early stage of development</strong>, and it's very possible that my vision for it will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447760?t=1773751418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447760?t=1773751418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/d3642cfe323477fa4b8ad4a65d223358dc59b1cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773751418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/d3642cfe323477fa4b8ad4a65d223358dc59b1cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773751418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a relatively young solo indie game developer (me). The game revolves around two game modes:\u00a0<strong>Wave Survival</strong> (solo / co-op) and\u00a0<strong>PvP</strong> (1 vs 1 battles) on a procedurally generated maps, all presented in a cheerful pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, there are <strong>two</strong> factions in the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bees</strong> are a more aggressive, army-based faction focused on developing new technologies like electricity and creating long-range units.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/69357eb53f6f7b3182f852dee169b638.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Termites</strong> are more focused on base building, and their gameplay is closer to tower defense. The termites economy is based on transporting materials to the base using roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/44303bd53e04f417c46c83ce6c3c40f4.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has <strong>procedurally generated</strong> maps with different biomes and a <strong>map editor</strong> where you can let your imagination run wild. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/974bfee90122b265035b0458b5138d29.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an <strong>early stage of development</strong>, and it's very possible that my vision for it will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.poster.avif?t=1773751418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.webm?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/b15263fe38185a15a518a7c9eae46826.mp4?t=1773751418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TerraDevlog"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/header.jpg?t=1773751418","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Lustle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","reco